  "question": "Can the earlier 2004 Ji Shuying text 《百川归海，蔚为大观》 be established as a formal published route with a lawful physical holding, and can its relationship to the 2009 《冀淑英古籍善本十五讲》 be closed without directly reviewing the relevant postscript/editor note?",
  "answer": "The 2004 article identity and a lawful physical holding route are closed; the 2009-to-2004 source genealogy is not. A National Library of China-hosted publication and a Taiwan National Central Library journal article independently cite Ji Shuying's 2004 《百川归海，蔚为大观》 as a text in 《冀淑英文集》, Beijing Library Press. Tokyo Metropolitan Library's public Digital BookShelf exposes a 2004.9 physical holding of 《冀淑英文集》 at displayed shelf sequence 022.0 / 6001 / 2004, and CiNii Books independently lists the title at 11 libraries. A secondary Shuge post reports, by reference to the 2009 postscript and 2004 editor note, that the 2009 Fifteen Lectures is an illustrated expansion of the earlier lecture transcript; because the project has not directly reviewed those two source statements or collated the texts, that derivation remains SECONDARY_REPORTED_NOT_DIRECTLY_CLOSED.",
